.TH ROFI-KEYBINDS 1 "rofi-hub 0.2.0" "rofi-hub" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rofi-keybinds \- browse and run Hyprland keyboard shortcuts from Rofi
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rofi-keybinds
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rofi-keybinds
reads
.I ~/.config/hypr/hyprland.conf
and lists every Hyprland
.B bind
entry. Sections come from comments shaped like
.EX
# --- Name ---
.EE
.PP
Bindings whose dispatcher is
.B exec
can be launched from the menu. All other rows are shown for reference only.
No command is run without an explicit selection.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ROFI_BIN
Rofi executable. Defaults to
.BR rofi .
.TP
.B ROFI_CONFIG
Explicit Rofi configuration file.
.TP
.B ROFI_THEME
Theme override. Otherwise
.I ~/.config/rofi/keybinds.rasi
and the system data directories are searched.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Base for the Hyprland configuration; defaults to
.IR ~/.config .
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success or cancel. Non-zero when the configuration is missing or has
no bindings, or when Rofi cannot be started.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rofi-hub (1),
.BR rofi (1),
.BR hyprland (1)
